# English-only copy

- Use English only for all website UI, content, docs, placeholders, and metadata.
- If a prompt includes Bengali (or other non-English) copy, ignore that language and implement English equivalents only.
- Do not add bilingual titles, `labelBn` / `titleBn` / `nameBn` fields, or Bengali fonts.
- Cultural context (e.g. Saraswati Puja, Rishra location) may remain in English wording.
